</header><section id="services"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">01</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">What we do.</h2><p class="lead">Four services, one machine on site - the tree comes down, the mulch stays where you need it.</p></div></div>
  <div class="svc-grid">
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Tree mulching</h3><p>Whole tree chipped on site into clean mulch for garden beds, paths or removal - your call.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Tree removal</h3><p>Safe sectional felling and straight drops - confined spaces, near structures, power lines.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Vegetation clearing</h3><p>Overgrowth, scrub, regrowth and block clearing - mulched in place or hauled off.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc rv"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Stump grinding</h3><p>Grind below grade, backfill with chips or soil - ready for turf, paving or replanting.</p></div><span class="svc-arrow">&#8599;</span></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="band" id="process"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">02</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">How a job runs.</h2></div></div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">01</span><div><h3>Site look & quote</h3><p>Walk the site, check access and targets - firm written quote before any gear moves.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">02</span><div><h3>Fell & chip</h3><p>Tree removed in sections, fed through the chipper - mulch arcs to the pile you choose.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">03</span><div><h3>Stumps & tidy</h3><p>Grind stumps below grade, rake the mulch bed level, sweep paths and driveways clean.</p></div></div>
    <div class="step rv"><span class="step-n">04</span><div><h3>Sign off</h3><p>Walk the finished site with you - job done, no debris left behind.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="faq"><div class="wrap faq-wrap">
  <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-idx">03</span><div><h2 class="sec-title">Asked on every job.</h2></div></div>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you chip the tree on site or haul it away?</summary><div class="a">We chip on site by default - the mulch is yours for beds or paths. If you want it removed, we load and take it.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Can you work near houses, fences or power lines?</summary><div class="a">Yes - sectional rigging and controlled drops let us work in tight spots. Power line clearance follows Western Power rules.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Is the mulch fresh or aged?</summary><div class="a">Fresh from your tree. It breaks down fast, feeds soil and holds moisture. For formal beds we can screen fines on request.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Do you grind stumps below grade?</summary><div class="a">Standard is 150-200 mm below grade. Deeper on request - ready for turf, pavers or a new tree.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>What areas do you cover?</summary><div class="a">Perth metro and outer suburbs - north to Yanchep, south to Mandurah, east to Mundaring.</div></details>
  <details class="faq rv"><summary>Are you insured?</summary><div class="a">Yes - public liability current. Certificate on request.</div></details>
</div></section>

